{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/136","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/136/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/136/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/136/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/136","id":6015032957,"node_id":"I_kwDOVV8PH88AAAABZoYefQ","number":136,"title":"[Medium][UI-033] Cupertino slider accessibility snapping fails for negative target values","user":{"login":"Apdelrahman1911","id":104788132,"node_id":"U_kgDOBj7wpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104788132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12821065352,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHuiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/area:ui","name":"area:ui","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: area:ui","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821065878,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHwlg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/audit","name":"audit","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: audit","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821066851,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DH0Yw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/evidence:confirmed-test","name":"evidence:confirmed-test","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: evidence:confirmed-test","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821069828,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DIABA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/priority:medium","name":"priority:medium","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: priority:medium","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-24T16:23:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:06Z","closed_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- nativecmpkit-item:audit:UI-033 -->\n## Classification\n- **Finding:** UI-033\n- **Priority:** Medium\n- **Evidence status:** `confirmed-test` (source/test evidence is not automatically a demonstrated exploit)\n- **Affected modules:** `calf-ui`\n- **Estimated complexity:** S\n- **Reviewed upstream baseline:** `af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6`; original commit preserved in this repository.\n\n## Exact code / symbols\n- [`calf-ui/src/iosMain/kotlin/com/mohamedrejeb/calf/ui/slider/CupertinoSlider.kt:662-704`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6/calf-ui/src/iosMain/kotlin/com/mohamedrejeb/calf/ui/slider/CupertinoSlider.kt#L662-L704) — `Modifier.cupertinoSliderSemantics`\n\n## Root cause\nThe discrete setProgress search initializes distance to newValue instead of a nonnegative distance/infinity. When the coerced target is negative, every abs(step-originalValue)<=distance comparison fails and the unsnapped target is emitted.\n\n## Impact and preconditions\nAccessibility adjustments can violate the discrete steps domain for negative ranges even though pointer/tick snapping uses different logic. For-1..1 with three interior steps, a requested-0.7 remains-0.7 rather than snapping to-0.5.\n\n## Supporting evidence\n- All cited source locations refer to immutable upstream baseline af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6.\n- distance:Float=newValue at line678 is compared against abs(step-originalValue) at685.\n- Executed the exact extracted cupertinoSliderSemantics helper with a capture-only Modifier/semantics stub: range-1..1,steps3,target-0.7 emits-0.7; positive0.7 control snaps to0.5. No Compose runtime/VoiceOver was loaded. See docs/testing/ui-source-probes.py and evidence/ui-source-probes.txt.\n\n## Recommended solution\nInitialize minimum distance to positive infinity or use a shared nearest-tick helper, with deterministic ties. Align semantic, tap and drag snapping behavior.\n\n## Risks and compatibility\nThe arithmetic defect is independent of UIKit. The harness may extract this exact helper with Compose semantics stubs; such a probe is not a real accessibility integration test.\n\n## Required tests / acceptance criteria\n- Semantic setProgress on-1..1,steps3,target-0.7 expects-0.5.\n- All-negative range, zero/positive ranges, ties/endpoints and callback completion.\n\n## Dependencies\n- None identified.\n\n## Historical context\n- None identified.\nOriginal upstream records (authors, IDs, timestamps, comments, reviews and public revisions) are archived in [`docs/migration/upstream-metadata/`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/tree/main/docs/migration/upstream-metadata). Links above are attribution; this issue is newly created for the independent project, not an impersonated original.\n\n## Persistent technical record\n[`docs/audit/findings/UI.json`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/findings/UI.json) · [Audit](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/README.md) · [Roadmap](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/roadmap/README.md)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Apdelrahman1911","id":104788132,"node_id":"U_kgDOBj7wpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104788132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/136/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}